# The pod base has no COPY from the build context — it installs a toolchain and
# nothing else. Excluding everything makes the context transfer a no-op rather
# than a several-second upload of a repository the build will not read.
#
# BuildKit reads `<dockerfile>.dockerignore` in preference to any
# `.dockerignore` at the context root, so this affects only this build. The
# merged image keeps `engine/Dockerfile.dockerignore`; the core-only image at
# the repository root keeps the root `.dockerignore`.
**
